{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01825","headline":"杂曲歌辞 古离别 · 赵微明","name":"杂曲歌辞 古离别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"违别未几日，一日如三秋。\n犹疑望可见，日日上高楼。\n惟见分手处，白苹满芳洲。\n寸心宁死别，不忍生离愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵微明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}